title: "Local Address Repair with a LoRA-Tuned MiniCPM5-1B"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible local pipeline for repairing messy German address records
  with deterministic rules, a LoRA-tuned MiniCPM5-1B model, validation, and
  per-decision audit support.
